    "expectedRule": "Lost Shelter tracks a survivor HP integer clamped to 0-100, starting at 100, and three escort checkpoints (north_checkpoint, central_checkpoint, south_checkpoint) each resolved once via law/resolve-escort-checkpoint with treat or push. Entering an unresolved checkpoint sets it pending; a pending checkpoint blocks departure (护送检查点尚未处理，请先选择救治或强推。) until resolved. Treat costs 1 run healing pill (0 with lu_guanlan rank 2 triage) and heals 25 HP plus 10 per triage rank and 10 with triage_visor equipped, clamped at 100; treat is unavailable when HP is already full (幸存者生命已经全满。). Push lowers survivor HP by 10 (0 with zhou_yingxue rank 2 analysis) and pays 200 reward points via applyRunReward to both state.rewardPoints (durable) and state.run.lootBag.rewardPoints (run track). Resolve logs 护送检查点已救治：消耗本轮止血丹 N，幸存者生命 X/100。 or 护送检查点已强推：本局奖励点 +200，幸存者生命 X/100。. Clearing a dangerous node (monster or trap) lowers survivor HP by 10 for a monster or 15 for a trap, reduced by 4 with rescue_carbine equipped and by 5 with evacuation_plate equipped, clamped at 0; the first hazard of the run is fully guarded when qin_che rank at least 2 is the active companion (firstHazardGuardUsed flips true and the role shows 秦彻：首次险情护卫). Resolving without a pending checkpoint, after all three are resolved, or after the boss snapshot is frozen is rejected as domain-rejected (The command did not produce a domain transition.); re-selecting a cleared checkpoint is rejected already-resolved. Entry gear (rescueCarbine, triageVisor, evacuationPlate, blackboxBeacon) and the active companion snapshot are frozen at run/enter into law.entryGear and law.entryCompanion and persist across the run and save-codec round-trip. Route gates: shelter_evacuation_cache_south_in (north_entry to evacuation_cache) opens only when all three checkpoints are resolved and survivor HP is at least 75 (完成三处检查点且幸存者HP至少75。); shelter_desperate_armory_west_in (mimic_survivor_alpha to desperate_armory) opens only when all three are resolved and HP is at most 40 (完成三处检查点且幸存者HP不高于40。); shelter_balanced_medbay_north_in (lower_return_portal to balanced_medbay) opens only when all three are resolved and HP is between 41 and 74 (完成三处检查点且幸存者HP为41-74。); shelter_memory_boss_gate (survivor_memory_stage to shelter_overseer) opens only when all three are resolved. The three HP-band gates are mutually exclusive, so only one reward cache can open per run. Closed gates remove edges from legal adjacent targets so run/move through them is rejected illegal-move. Starting the shelter_overseer boss combat (run/select-node) with all checkpoints resolved freezes bossSurvivorSnapshot = clamp(survivorHp + blackboxBeacon*10, 0, 100) and freezes further checkpoint choices (首领战幸存者状态已冻结。); the display appends Boss快照 N. Boss modifiers during the boss encounter derive from survivor HP: at HP at least 75 the player gains encounter.allStatsPercent -6 and outgoingDamage force/art +6; at HP 1-40 encounter.allStatsPercent +6 and outgoing +4; at HP 0 encounter.allStatsPercent +12 and outgoing +8. The boss is a real multi-round combat (monsterHp 1413, bossPhase sealed). The law display status is 幸存者HP X/100，北:Y，中:Y，南:Y，救治 T，强推 P，run止血丹 N，救治 HP+0/耗药0，强推 HP+0/奖励0，卡宾枪:有/无，目镜:有/无，护甲:有/无，信标:有/无，<companion role>，护卫:未用/已用，研判:未用/已用，分诊:未用/已用，Boss快照 未冻结|N with severity stable/warning/danger/resolved and meter {value: survivorHp, max: 100}; the escort-correct API is core.getCurrentEscortCheckpointStatus. Law state, checkpoint choices, survivor HP, entry gear, companion snapshot, boss snapshot, and reward points persist through a save-codec round-trip. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
